  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "For people making avatars and testing new experiments, sometimes those experiments lead to crazy uncontrollable conditions in which accessing the menu to switch to a safe avatar is difficult. I cant tell you how many times I was testing an experimental avatar that for inexplicable reasons spin me uncontrollably, or made me fall through the floor at godspeed, or shot me across the map - and my menu couldnt keep up with me so trying to switch to an emergency avatar to stop the craziness didnt work. Im proposing either a \"blank avatar\" front button or having the menu track more solidly with the player.",
